msgid "**4.3.8 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.3.8 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.8.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Controller Filters:** In previous versions, ``['except' => []]`` or "
"``['except' => '']`` meant \"except all\". The bug has been fixed, and now"
msgstr ""
"**컨트롤러 필터:** 이전 버전에서 ``['except' => []]`` 또는 ``['except' => '']``\\ 은 \"모두 "
"제외\"\\ 를 의미했습니다. 버그가 수정되었으며, 이제"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.8.rst:18
