#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.0.rst:267
msgid ""
"**Table:** Added ``Table::setSyncRowsWithHeading()`` method to synchronize "
"row columns with headings. See :ref:`table-sync-rows-with-headings` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"**테이블:** 행 컬럼을 제목과 동기화하는 ``Table::setSyncRowsWithHeading()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`table-sync-rows-with-headings`\\ 를 참고하세요."

