"**CORS 필터** (*기여:* `kenjis <https://github.com/kenjis>`_) "
":doc:`../libraries/cors`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"The **spark optimize** command for performance improvement on production "
"environment (*contributed by* `kenjis <https://github.com/kenjis>`_). See "
