#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:32
msgid "Required Filters"
msgstr "필수 필터"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"New :ref:`Required Filters <filters-required>` have been introduced. They "
"are special filters that are applied before and after other kinds of "
"filters, and always applied even if a route does not exist."
msgstr ""
"새로운 :ref:`필수 필터 <filters-required>`\\ 가 도입되었습니다. 이는 다른 종류의 필터 전후에 적용되는 특별한 "
"필터로, 라우트가 존재하지 않아도 항상 적용됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"The following existing functionalities have been reimplemented as Required "
"Filters."
msgstr "다음 기존 기능들이 필수 필터로 재구현되었습니다."

