msgid ""
"``routing``: Instantiating RouteCollection object, Loading Routes files, "
"Instantiating Router object, Routing,"
msgstr ""
"``routing``: RouteCollection 객체 인스턴스화, Routes 파일 로딩, Router 객체 인스턴스화, 라우팅,"

