msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.5.2 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.2.rst:17
msgid "Added ``Security.insecureCookie`` message."
msgstr "``Security.insecureCookie`` 메시지가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.3.rst:3
